---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section aircraft-section" id="aircraft">
  <div class="container aircraft-grid">
    <div class="aircraft-copy reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> THE TRAINING AIRCRAFT</p>
      <h2>A practical airplane for building real skills.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Train in a personally operated, single-engine aircraft suited for foundational flight instruction and consistent skill development.
      </p>
      <div class="spec-list">
        <div><span><Icon name="check" size={17} /></span><div><strong>Consistent access</strong><p>A dedicated training aircraft helps make scheduling and lesson continuity simpler.</p></div></div>
        <div><span><Icon name="check" size={17} /></span><div><strong>Hands-on learning</strong><p>Practice preflight inspections, aircraft care, cockpit procedures, and real-world decision-making.</p></div></div>
        <div><span><Icon name="check" size={17} /></span><div><strong>Details coming soon</strong><p>Add the make, model, avionics, hourly rates, useful load, and aircraft photos before publishing.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="aircraft-card reveal reveal-delay">
      <div class="aircraft-card-top">
        <span>TRAINING AIRCRAFT</span>
        <span class="status"><i></i> Athens area</span>
      </div>
      <div class="aircraft-drawing">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 760 380" role="img" aria-label="Stylized single-engine training airplane">
          <path d="M91 237H280L332 202H412L471 237H669L707 259H461L425 323H371L386 259H306L273 296H226L247 259H94L58 249L91 237Z" fill="#F7FAFC" stroke="#082B45" stroke-width="7" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <path d="M337 203L353 142H382L389 202" fill="#2F6F94" stroke="#082B45" stroke-width="7" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <path d="M371 202V258" stroke="#082B45" stroke-width="7" />
          <path d="M101 260H664" stroke="#D99A2B" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <circle cx="300" cy="286" r="16" fill="#082B45" />
          <circle cx="468" cy="286" r="16" fill="#082B45" />
          <path d="M392 184C427 164 458 168 491 188" stroke="#82B2CC" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="aircraft-meta">
        <div><span>TYPE</span><strong>Single-engine trainer</strong></div>
        <div><span>USE</span><strong>Primary instruction</strong></div>
        <div><span>MODEL</span><strong>Details coming soon</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
